## 🏗 Phase 1: Project Setup & Foundation

### 📦 Module 1: Backend Initialization
- **Folder Structure**: `server/`
- **Tasks**:
  - [x] Initialize Node.js project (`npm init -y`)
  - [x] Install core dependencies: `express`, `mongoose`, `dotenv`, `cors`, `cookie-parser`, `jsonwebtoken`, `bcryptjs`
  - [x] Setup `.env` file with `PORT`, `MONGO_URI`, and `JWT_SECRET`
  - [x] Create `server/src/database/Db.js` for MongoDB connection
  - [x] Create basic `server/index.js` with middleware setup
- **Git Checkpoint**: `git commit -m "chore: setup backend foundation and db connection"`

### 🎨 Module 2: Frontend Initialization
- **Folder Structure**: `client/`
- **Tasks**:
  - [x] Initialize React project with Vite (`npx create-vite@latest client --template react`)
  - [x] Install frontend dependencies: `tailwindcss`, `axios`, `react-router-dom`, `lucide-react`, `framer-motion`
  - [x] Configure Tailwind CSS with the design palette (Maroon: #8B0000, Gold: #FFD700)
  - [x] Setup folder structure: `src/components`, `src/pages`, `src/context`, `src/services`, `src/hooks`, `src/utils`
  - [x] Define basic routing in `App.jsx` (Home, Login, Register)
- **Git Checkpoint**: `git commit -m "chore: setup frontend foundation with vite and tailwind"`

